  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">완성된&#160;눈구조&#160;모형</span></b>은 <br><br>이것입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/893fc3246809d91f4d7edb9e5c406a0fd883af75\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/893fc3246809d91f4d7edb9e5c406a0fd883af75\" data-origin-width=\"526\" data-origin-height=\"376\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>핀터레스트에&#160;비슷한&#160;모형을&#160;보고 <br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">A4&#160;한&#160;장으로&#160;만들&#160;수&#160;있게&#160;디자인</span></b>해보았습니다. <br>&#160; <br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">[준비물:&#160;A4&#160;1장&#160;+&#160;투명테이프&#160;+&#160;가위]</span></b> <br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/96fffa45b1d7e90f2056c6251d949620ac1f6452\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/96fffa45b1d7e90f2056c6251d949620ac1f6452\" data-origin-width=\"558\" data-origin-height=\"398\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">점<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">선</span>은 접고, </span>실선</span>은&#160;모두&#160;컷!</span></b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c4f5dbe025fe4beec930c221fb34e573a3c6ef52\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c4f5dbe025fe4beec930c221fb34e573a3c6ef52\" data-origin-width=\"549\" data-origin-height=\"402\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #409d00;\">눈을 둘러싼 3막을 띠지 3개로 표현</span></b>했고, <br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(공막/맥락막/망막)</span></b> <br><span style=\"color: #0593d3;\"><b>유리체도</b> </span>만들어 끼웠습니다.<br><br>조원과&#160;각&#160;부분의&#160;명칭을&#160;예상해보고, <br><b><span style=\"color: #0593d3;\">아래&#160;과정샷을&#160;드라이브&#160;링크로&#160;제공</span></b>하여&#160; <br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">스.스.로. 탐구하고, 스.스.로. 만들기!</span></b><br>조원과&#160;상의하여&#160;만들&#160;수&#160;있게&#160;지도하였습니다.<br><br>&#160; <br>그렇지&#160;않으면....<b>아마&#160;질문을&#160;100만번하겠지요.</b>&#160;허허허;;; <br>&#160; <br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>과정샷</b>을&#160;올려드려요.&#160;</span><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/356ca660d495f83f6963af092e69df748c70e50c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/356ca660d495f83f6963af092e69df748c70e50c\" data-origin-width=\"947\" data-origin-height=\"678\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/01cb56c6a57e45e2362639a6c21b33f19ee94bd6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/01cb56c6a57e45e2362639a6c21b33f19ee94bd6\" data-origin-width=\"911\" data-origin-height=\"680\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2595639060c976e1aa56c156c2f07eae7c7ff921\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2595639060c976e1aa56c156c2f07eae7c7ff921\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6f38cb5e4b50f625f909868d8ea5a7d0800346b9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6f38cb5e4b50f625f